(card "exp:D-R1-3_drop_full_consensus" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:D-R1-3_drop_full_consensus"
  :body "---\nnav: 24\ntype: experiment\nid: D-R1-3_drop_full_consensus\nshort_name: drop_full_consensus\ntitle: \"D-R1-3 — anchor + post-filter drop lc_48h == 2 (drop full cross-source crowd)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: d\nround: r1\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_d__blacklist_default_admit]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.1011\ntrain_trade_count: 129\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8605\ntrain_sharpe: 7.7581\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0574\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0690\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.2117\ntest_trade_count: 16\ntest_sharpe: 7.0792\ntest_win_rate: 0.75\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0053\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: test_fail\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [blacklist, cross_source]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T02:00:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/d, round/r1, axis/blacklist, axis/cross_source, status/falsified, outcome/test_fail, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# D-R1-3 — anchor + drop lc_48h == 2 (drop full crowd)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— D-R1-3 是 D-R2-3 stack 中 \"lc_48h==2 blacklist\" 单独 component 的 anchor-base 验证。train NAV 2.10 < anchor 2.19, **test 1.21 < anchor 1.25** —— single blacklist 即 hold-out 上失败。验证 lc_48h cross-source crowd 在 anchor pool 上不是 productive blacklist。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：过去 48h 内同源 cross-source crowd 已 confirm 的 leg → 已被吃 → drop 应当 ↑ NAV。\n- 实测：anchor pool 上砍 11 笔（140→129），train NAV 反降 0.09。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/scripts/round_1_runner.py`\n- 步骤：anchor G2 → drop leg if `lc_48h == 2`.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- `lc_48h` past-only. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.1011 | 129 | 7.76 | 86.0% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0574 ± 0.069 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.2117 | 16 | 7.08 | 75.0% | -0.53% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | **-0.037 (FAIL)** | -4 | -0.07 | 0 | 0 |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0.\n- 真实问题：cross-source crowd 在 anchor pool 上**没区分 ability**。\n- vault contribution: 单独 component 在 anchor base 上 hold-out 失败，但 D-R2-3 把它作 stack 第一条 → **stack 是把 noise 放大，不是把 signal 放大**的反例。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **mechanism_used_by**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-3__blacklist_stack_triple]] (作 stack 第一条)\n- **mechanism_used_by**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-2__blacklist_cross_source]] (default-admit base 同 axis)\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R1-1__consensus_gte1]], [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R1-2__isolated_keep]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (D-R1-3)\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/output/cross_team_test_nav_ranking_v2.csv` (D-R1-3)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- 重要 lesson: **单 component blacklist 在 anchor base 上 hold-out 失败，但被 stack 进 default-admit baseline 后 train NAV 涨**。这说明 stack 涨的部分是 \"default-admit 引入的弱 leg 被 stack 随机砍掉\" 的统计 noise，不是 mechanism merit。\n- 任何 stack 候选必须 verify **每个 component 在自己 base 上能 strict beat baseline**，否则 stack 是 false positive。D-R2-3 / D-R2-4 都没做这步，付出 hold-out 崩盘代价。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_d__D-R1-3__drop_full_consensus.md"
